assign_id.description:
The module answered on {port} with Modbus ID {current_id}.

Choose the ID it will keep. This ID identifies the module: if its adapter comes back under another port name after a reboot, the integration finds the module by this ID. The suggested value is the next free one, starting at 10. If it differs from the current ID, it is written to the module now.

IDs already used by configured modules: {used_ids}
